---
title: "realtime_notification (kintai-v3 企画書: 部活動勤怠管理システム)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_init: kiosk or client app loads
    q_init --> q_subscribe: establish Supabase Realtime subscription
    q_subscribe --> q_listening: subscribed to notification channel
    q_listening --> q_receive: new notification event received
    q_listening --> q_reconnect: connection lost
    q_reconnect --> q_subscribe: reconnect with backoff
    q_receive --> q_parse: parse notification payload
    q_parse --> q_display: render notification on screen
    q_display --> q_listening: return to listening state

    note right of q_subscribe
        INV-001: subscription uses authenticated channel (RLS enforced)
        INV-002: only admin-created notifications are broadcast
    end note

    note right of q_receive
        INV-003: notifications are displayed in real-time (instant update)
        INV-004: notification payload is validated before rendering
    end note

    note right of q_reconnect
        INV-005: reconnection uses exponential backoff
        INV-006: no notifications are lost during brief disconnections
    end note
